              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "a3e6f12f-0091-57eb-9b78-79f621ab7410",
            "x": 630,
            "y": 148.1,
            "width": 520,
            "height": 119,
            "order": 3,
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": 3,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Q. 途中入塾はできますか？"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "block",
                "paragraphSize": 0.4,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "A. いつでも入塾できます。現在の学習状況に合わせて指導します。",
                    "fontSize": 18
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "0e4bf52e-8547-5d88-8c25-c702604b8869",
            "x": 50,
            "y": 296.884,
            "width": 520,
            "height": 87,
            "order": 4,
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": 3,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Q. 複数科目の受講はできますか？"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "block",
                "paragraphSize": 0.4,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "A. はい。ご希望に合わせて組み合わせられます。",
                    "fontSize": 18
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "77d92c58-e950-5d61-8a35-d51a013b9c21",
            "x": 630,
            "y": 296.884,
            "width": 520,
            "height": 87,
            "order": 5,
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": 3,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Q. 宿題はどのくらい出ますか？"
